ng on the  stage  back soon what is the feeling you get  right before taking the stage for a  taping  well when we have a live audience it's  always like um  my adrenaline is like just running it's  i'm pumped i'm excited  um and it really hits an all-time high  when there have been a few times where  literally before the live show starts  the house is coming undone and it's  flipping like you think you're prepared  you think okay  someone says i was going to get evicted  tonight this is how the vote's going to  go down and then suddenly  things just get  blown apart  um but my heart usually races a little  bit  and um i get not nervous but like nerds  i get like excitement  uh  you know i love live i love live  television  well and speaking of live television and  speaking of the audience we've missed  the audience the past couple seasons  will we have an audience back in the  studio this season with you we were  hoping to at this point we are not going  to launch with a live studio audience  whether or not that changes by the end  of the summer here's praying i'm hopeful  that it will  i'm hopeful too i always feel like when  you have the audience there you kind of  also get a feeling as to  who people are liking who people are not  liking based off of reactions  yes you know i mean they will scream it  out like even before we go live they're  like i hope someone sell gauze tonight  or you know we love so and so um  and that always it's it's fun to watch  it's fun to see and also when the person  gets evicted for them to like walk out  you know instead of with their tail  between their legs then they walk out to  like a cheering crowd that you know we  love you and it's it's very uplifting  it's nice to feel it's nice to be a part  of and to see  with so much experience as the host of  big brother i'm curious do you think  you'd ever make a good house guest  i would make a terrible house guest  because i  it's not in my nature to deceive or to  lie you know i'm a 